What would your family say
if they knew about all this?

255
00:16:54,300 --> 00:16:55,897
Let go of me.

256
00:16:55,980 --> 00:17:00,745
You've been stitched together like a
ragdoll, forced to serve as an undead slave.

257
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:02,317
Your loved ones would be mortified.

258
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:03,900
Okay, unhand me.

259
00:17:04,520 --> 00:17:09,077
You were born with both a body and a
soul, but that soul died a long time ago.

260
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:12,157
And yet your body is being
forced to follow orders.

261
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:13,887
Where's the meaning in that?

262
00:17:14,340 --> 00:17:16,080
Force, force, force, force.

263
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:19,137
Don't tell me you doubt
your own eyes, Doctor.

264
00:17:19,220 --> 00:17:21,297
This is what humans
have always dreamed of.

265
00:17:21,380 --> 00:17:22,851
Resurrection of the dead.

266
00:17:23,860 --> 00:17:25,500
Man can live again.

267
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:31,588
Just because it moves
doesn't make it alive.

268
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:34,460
To be alive, you've got to be free!

269
00:17:34,780 --> 00:17:36,417
You're treating her like she's nothing!

270
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:39,676
Anything that exists like
that can't be a human being!

271
00:17:49,100 --> 00:17:51,680
Darkma Tackle! Help her! Quickly!

272
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:53,190
Save Century!

273
00:17:53,273 --> 00:17:54,181
Kill the others!

274
00:17:58,580 --> 00:18:00,800
Oh, no! Chopper!

275
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:04,980
Gleason style, 108!

276
00:18:07,180 --> 00:18:08,940
All about me!

277
00:18:11,840 --> 00:18:13,620
Zoro, stop it!

278
00:18:14,380 --> 00:18:16,500
Now, don't save Fleur!

279
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:23,600
My master said, kill the others!

280
00:18:28,700 --> 00:18:31,460
Careful with that attack
you almost killed me.

281
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:34,400
Stay the hell out of my way!

282
00:18:38,320 --> 00:18:39,677
You're in my way.

283
00:18:39,760 --> 00:18:41,757
I was doing fine till you saw.

284
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:43,457
Master told me to kill the others.

285
00:18:43,540 --> 00:18:45,977
Yes I know that we have
the same master you idiot.

286
00:18:46,060 --> 00:18:47,080
Now back off.

287
00:18:48,420 --> 00:18:49,597
You back off.

288
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:52,268
He said kill the others
I'll start with you.

289
00:18:54,120 --> 00:18:55,117
Cut it out!

290
00:18:55,200 --> 00:19:01,500
What the hell are you idiots doing stop
fighting now we need to work together right.

291
00:19:04,820 --> 00:19:07,537
Can't give orders if you
can't talk if the others

292
00:19:07,620 --> 00:19:09,877
are everyone but Shandora
who knows what could end

293
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:13,917
up happening even without
any trace of their old

294
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:16,297
memories those two just
can't seem to get along.

295
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:17,733
No matter what they do.

296
00:19:22,860 --> 00:19:27,137
This tower is rather tall isn't
it huh if only we were under

297
00:19:27,220 --> 00:19:30,749
your power you could kill us
by asking us to jump out of it.

298
00:19:31,180 --> 00:19:32,010
Huh?

299
00:19:32,180 --> 00:19:35,317
How dare you speak to
me that way you'll be

300
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:38,341
under my control once I
turn you into zombies and!

301
00:19:38,860 --> 00:19:43,180
Once I do I'll say jump off this
tower and put an end to yourself?

302
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:48,720
Yes, master! Oh!

303
00:19:51,900 --> 00:19:53,800
No way! That was a mistake!

304
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:08,820
As for us, we'd rather not.

305
00:20:09,100 --> 00:20:12,980
Oh no, dammit!

306
00:20:13,520 --> 00:20:16,360
You pathetic excuses
for humans tricked me!

307
00:20:16,740 --> 00:20:18,387
I'm supposed to be a genius!

308
00:20:18,980 --> 00:20:21,037
Now, once Luffy's dealt with Moria,

309
00:20:21,120 --> 00:20:24,057
all the zombies he created on
this island will be purified,

310
00:20:24,140 --> 00:20:28,377
which means the only thing left for
me to do around here is kick your ass!

311
00:20:28,460 --> 00:20:29,342
Century, listen!

312
00:20:29,540 --> 00:20:32,069
I need you to buy some
time while I escape!

313
00:20:32,620 --> 00:20:33,450
Hey!

314
00:20:33,533 --> 00:20:35,137
Didn't you hear me? Get them!

315
00:20:35,220 --> 00:20:39,514
It doesn't matter if they purify you,
I can just give you another shadow!

316
00:20:41,540 --> 00:20:42,417
My body...

317
00:20:42,500 --> 00:20:44,740
It won't move.

318
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:47,020
What? Send me!
